{
    "2": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I suppose you won't believe in",
                "what I have to say, will you?"
            ]
        },
        "158_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's really there, in the recesses.",
                "You should see it for yourself."
            ]
        },
        "282_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A monster consumed by information!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh my?"
            ]
        },
        "152_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Could you be",
                "the magician from Gensokyo?"
            ]
        },
        "160_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What are you doing",
                "in a place like this?"
            ]
        },
        "208_0": {
            "lines": [
                "When you're here, you can understand",
                "all the truths of this world."
            ]
        },
        "216_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You are still a pitiful obsolete human",
                "who has not yet awakened."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Never thought I'd be getting",
                "tips from that youkai."
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She said a new threat",
                "has emerged in the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah, there's no mistaking this intensity."
            ]
        },
        "168_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey you, where exactly",
                "are you from?"
            ]
        },
        "176_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was originally from here."
            ]
        },
        "184_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm a youkai born in this place."
            ]
        },
        "192_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why does a youkai like you",
                "know about me?"
            ]
        },
        "200_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The pyramid gathers",
                "all sorts of information."
            ]
        },
        "224_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me show you for real!",
                "The truth of this world! The <i$ultimate truth>!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How's that!",
                "I won!"
            ]
        },
        "42_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No way, I can't believe",
                "the truth was defeated..."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Waaah... The thing is... I'm just a fossilized shellfish",
                "that had been dormant here, you see..."
            ]
        },
        "50_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I get why youkai",
                "don't want to approach the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "58_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's because they'd end up like you",
                "if they stayed here."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's wrong with",
                "ending up like me?"
            ]
        },
        "74_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Look, that youkai told me this."
            ]
        },
        "82_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Being taken over by information means",
                "becoming someone completely disposable."
            ]
        },
        "90_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Isn't that sad?",
                "I mean..."
            ]
        },
        "98_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Someone completely disposable..."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "See ya, Miss Completely-Disposable Youkai."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I just recently revived,",
                "and I still have no sense of self."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Please, don't abandon me!"
            ]
        },
        "138_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I see. Well then,",
                "get out of here right now!"
            ]
        },
        "146_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Throw away that so-called \"truth\"",
                "and enjoy the world on your own feet."
            ]
        },
        "154_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you promise to do that, I'll help you out."
            ]
        }
    }
}